    "created_at": "2014-09-25T15:24:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2014-09-25T15:24:57Z",
    "body": "Most controllers don't support making multiple concurrent connection attempts to devices, instead you have to serialize them, waiting until the connection to one device is complete before you attempt the next.\n\nI'm not sure this is an argument for `requestMultipleDevices` (handle the serialization for you) or against (request them one at a time like you're supposed to).\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
