    "updated_at": "2014-09-25T16:38:29Z",
    "body": "Thanks @keybuk. https://developer.chrome.com/apps/bluetoothLowEnergy#method-connect doesn't mention a need for developers to serialize their connection attempts, so I'm assuming the Chrome API handles the serialization for developers? I think I prefer that, since it's one less thing for web developers to get wrong.\n",
