    "created_at": "2015-10-01T16:13:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-01T16:13:11Z",
    "body": "(gentle ping)\n\nI've been playing with [BLE juggling balls from juggglow](http://juggglow.com) and requesting several devices at the same time would definitely improve the overall UX.\n\nI guess I could simply call `requestDevice` again for the second, the third one and so on.\nBut I'm not sure we distinguish the ones that are already \"paired/connected\" to the website in the chooser UI.\n",
